'''Sorceress Sidmi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

