==Trivia==
*In Japanese, Sidmi's name (シドミ ''Shidomi'') is one of the words for the [[wikipedia:Chaenomeles japonica|Japanese quince]], along with 草木瓜/クサボケ ''kusa-boke'' and ジナシ ''jinashi''. During the spring, this plant grows a bright red flower similar in color to Flame Mage Sidmi's eyes and parts of her outfit.
*Sidmi's [[Killer Cat (Rare Cat)|Killer Cats]] are likely a reference to how black cats are associated with witchcraft and jinxes, while the tanuki-like cat could be a ''[[wikipedia:Bake-danuki|bake-danuki]]'', a shapeshifting supernatural tanuki in Japanese folklore.
*Sorceress Sidmi was first made obtainable in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] on October 31st, 2025.
**In [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], she was first made obtainable on January 23rd, 2026.

